[{"id":8503760933,"node_id":"LE_lADOBC3Cis5eTw84zwAAAAH63Rgl","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/events/8503760933","actor":{"login":"dream-ellie","id":61736137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNzM2MTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61736137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dream-ellie","html_url":"https://github.com/dream-ellie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dream-ellie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dream-ellie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dream-ellie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dream-ellie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dream-ellie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dream-ellie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dream-ellie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dream-ellie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dream-ellie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2023-02-13T12:13:45Z","label":{"name":"template: bug","color":"fddf99"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/1428222066","html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/45850#issuecomment-1428222066","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/45850","id":1428222066,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBC3Cis5VIPBy","user":{"login":"kfirfitousi","id":37262772,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjYyNzcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37262772?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kfirfitousi","html_url":"https://github.com/kfirfitousi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kfirfitousi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kfirfitousi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kfirfitousi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kfirfitousi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kfirfitousi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kfirfitousi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kfirfitousi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kfirfitousi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kfirfitousi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-02-13T16:14:52Z","updated_at":"2023-02-13T16:20:08Z","body":"The problem comes from this function: \r\n\r\n```tsx\r\nfunction getPost(slug: string) {\r\n  const body = Posts[slug];\r\n\r\n  if (!body) {\r\n    throw new Error(`Unsupported slug ${slug}`);\r\n  }\r\n  return body;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nInstead of throwing an Error, you should use `notFound`:\r\n\r\n```tsx\r\nimport { notFound } from 'next/navigation';\r\n\r\nfunction getPost(slug: string) {\r\n  const body = Posts[slug];\r\n\r\n  if (!body) {\r\n    notFound();\r\n  }\r\n  return body;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis will also throw an Error, but Next.js can handle it gracefully.   \r\nYou can then add a `not-found.tsx` file to the `[slug]` directory. The component you export there will render when the `notFound` function is called:\r\n\r\n```tsx\r\n// app/posts/[slug]/not-found.tsx\r\n\r\nexport default function NotFound() {\r\n  return <h2>Page not found</h2>;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nHere's the StackBlitz link https://stackblitz.com/edit/vercel-next-js-rqv3nv?file=app/posts/[slug]/page.tsx","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/1428222066/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"kfirfitousi","id":37262772,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjYyNzcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37262772?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kfirfitousi","html_url":"https://github.com/kfirfitousi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kfirfitousi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kfirfitousi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kfirfitousi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kfirfitousi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kfirfitousi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kfirfitousi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kfirfitousi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kfirfitousi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kfirfitousi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/1428963445","html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/45850#issuecomment-1428963445","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/45850","id":1428963445,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBC3Cis5VLEB1","user":{"login":"dream-ellie","id":61736137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNzM2MTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61736137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dream-ellie","html_url":"https://github.com/dream-ellie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dream-ellie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dream-ellie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dream-ellie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dream-ellie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dream-ellie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dream-ellie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dream-ellie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dream-ellie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dream-ellie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-02-14T01:23:35Z","updated_at":"2023-02-14T01:25:13Z","body":"@kfirfitousi Thanks. Adding notFound will work around the issue that I have highlighted in this ticket by letting nextJS pre-render the \"Not Found\" page.\r\n\r\nBut this ticket is not about working around the problem in the example code. My example was a very simplified code to demonstrate the point.\r\n\r\nMy understanding (based on the documentation) that the notation `[<anything>]` tells NextJS that this is dynamic route segment and `<anything>` will be replaced with the actual value from the actual url at runtime.\r\nOr, **if I choose to**, can be pre-rendered by NextJS if I supply the `generateStaticParams()` function.\r\n\r\nThe problem is that I do not want to pre-render any single dynamic segment. I want them to be rendered dynamically at request time, hence no `generateStaticParams()` is given.\r\nAnd the fact that NextJS still tries to do it with obviously invalid value `\"[<anything>]\"` is incorrect or undocumented behaviour.\r\n\r\nNextJS should not be even trying to pre-render the dynamic page with the \"[slug]\" string as `slug` parameter.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/1428963445/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"dream-ellie","id":61736137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNzM2MTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61736137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dream-ellie","html_url":"https://github.com/dream-ellie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dream-ellie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dream-ellie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https:/